  "type": "MCQ",
  "question": "Consider a cubical box of $1$ m side which has one corner placed at $(0,0,0)$ and the opposite corner placed at $(1,1,1)$. The least distance that an ant crawling from the point $(0,0,0)$ to the point $(1,1,1)$ must travel is",
  "options": {
    "A": "$\\sqrt6$ m",
    "B": "$\\sqrt5$ m",
    "C": "$2\\sqrt3$ m",
    "D": "$1+\\sqrt3$ m"
  },
  "answer": "B",
